1
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,840
Since we're all Chinese,

2
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,400
so I came over to say hello.

3
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:55,000
Chinese or foreigner...

4
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,879
Does that make any difference here?

5
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,000
The locals here...

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,560
look down on outsiders like us.

7
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:07,040
The guy you fought is named Kano.

8
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:09,039
He's extremely jealous.

9
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,319
Watch your back.

10
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:12,800
You think he can take me?

11
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:17,960
What are you in for?

12
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,039
None of your business.

13
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:23,919
In a place like this,

14
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:25,840
without friends,

15
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,599
trying to stay alive...

16
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:29,240
is tough.

17
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,199
I get it.

18
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:41,879
You're in trouble with no backup.

19
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,000
Right.

20
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:44,759
I don't have time to make friends.

21
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,400
Didn't we get locked up just for him?

22
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,280
Playing hard to get.

23
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,000
No time to make friends?

24
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,159
Are you interested in money, then?

25
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,599
Who isn't interested in money?

26
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,639
I'm in here for robbery.

27
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,960
As far as I know,

28
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,960
this place only holds serious felons.

29
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:20,159
Robbery?

30
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,719
You... you think we just went after

31
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:26,360
petty street cash?

32
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,280
If we hadn't alerted The Four Great Families,

33
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:33,479
we'd have taken the cash and run.

34
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,919
To make that much noise,

35
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,919
you must be no small players.

36
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:47,080
Boss,

37
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,080
what did you get locked up for?

38
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,159
Framed.

39
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,240
Framed? You...

40
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,800
You'd better save that line

41
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:06,199
for the higher-ups.

42
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:08,879
Wait,

43
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:11,560
asking if we're interested in money,

44
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,840
what did you mean?

45
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,560
I'm a businessman.

46
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:22,360
If we can get out of here together,

47
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,639
I can promise you...

48
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:25,639
Come on, brother,

49
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,480
if I could get out of here,

50
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,560
I'd make you a cop.

51
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,279
Do you think standing on that high wall

52
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,279
is comfortable?

53
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:41,040
Let me tell you,

54
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,199
if we can break out of here,

55
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,240
I guarantee you'll make big money.

56
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,199
Big money?

57
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,240
Boss,

58
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,120
do you have a fever,

59
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,560
or are you dreaming?

60
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:57,800
We're...

61
00:04:58,319 --> 00:05:00,959
we're in Cyrano Prison right now.

62
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:04,199
This place holds maximum-security inmates.

63
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,639
You think we can

64
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,879
just walk out of here?

65
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,800
I noticed

66
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:14,319
you know how to handle the guards here.

67
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,399
My wife is outside.

68
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,439
If your boys

69
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,680
can get in touch with my wife,

70
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,959
and grease the guards' palms,

71
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,720
getting out won't be a problem.

72
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,199
As for money,

73
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:27,720
that's even less of an issue.

74
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,720
Look, buddy,

75
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,480
whatever you said today,

76
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,040
I didn't hear a word.

77
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:41,920
Move, move, let's go.

78
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,560
All the details

79
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,160
are documented in my report.

80
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,959
Chen Hai formed Runze Commerce 2 years ago

81
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:08,720
signing an equity deal with Longze Group.

82
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,720
Longze Group holds a 30% stake,

83
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,959
providing business consulting

84
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:13,800
and management services.

85
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,800
But in reality,

86
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,839
Longze Group hasn't actually

87
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:18,279
taken part in Runze Commerce's operations.

88
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,959
Over the past year,

89
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,199
a large amount of Runze Commerce's funds

90
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,360
was wired through Longze Group to

91
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,839
Singapore's Weiyuan International Trade.

92
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,680
I see what you mean.

93
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:32,360
Chen Hai is using Longze Group

94
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:36,120
to legally avoid taxes for Runze Commerce.

95
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:39,160
But I already knew that beforehand.

96
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,720
On paper,

97
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,160
what he's doing

98
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:47,439
hasn't caused our group

99
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,680
any losses.

100
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:52,519
In fact, it boosted our profit scale.

101
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:54,839
But we know

102
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,879
absolutely nothing about Runze Commerce.

103
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,879
Take last year, for instance.

104
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,040
Even when the solar PV industry

105
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,480
suffered a severe downturn,

106
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:02,759
Weiyuan International still bought

107
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,759
many solar panels through Runze Commerce.

108
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,240
It defies all logic.

109
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:10,839
The group holds shares in many companies

110
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:11,560
with the aim of

111
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,959
expanding

112
00:07:12,959 --> 00:07:14,800
the group's overall scale,

113
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,319
so we can go public sooner.

114
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:20,439
As for how these companies make money,

115
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,720
there's no need to interfere too much.

116
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:23,720
Of course,

117
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,279
once we fully acquire Runze Commerce,

118
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,680
the company will naturally step up

119
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,319
its oversight and management.

120
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:31,319
But the fund transfers of Runze Commerce

121
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:32,920
with Weiyuan International Trade

122
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,959
are highly suspicious.

123
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:35,879
Alright, that's enough.

124
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,360
The company brought you in

125
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:41,240
mainly out of concern that Chen Hai

126
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:43,240
was committing embezzlement.

127
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:45,879
Since you've looked into it

128
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,639
and found no such problem,

129
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,600
I can report back to the chairman.

130
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,439
As for you, moving forward,

131
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:56,279
just focus on doing your own job.

132
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,000
As for other matters,

133
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,959
don't worry about them anymore.

134
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:01,839
I'm sorry.

135
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,759
Chairman Long brought me here

136
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:06,360
specifically to look into these details.

137
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:08,600
Since I'm in this position,

138
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,319
I must verify every company transaction

139
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:15,800
and ensure it's legitimate and legal.

140
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,560
Legitimate and legal?

141
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:24,240
What do you mean?

142
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,639
I suspect

143
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,720
Chen Hai uses us for money laundering.

144
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:35,159
How confident are you

145
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,759
in your assessment?

146
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,320
How confident are you

147
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,360
If my assessment is wrong,

148
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,879
I will take the blame and resign.

149
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:51,799
Something this huge happened in the group,

150
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,120
why didn't you tell me sooner?

151
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,120
Because I wasn't completely certain before.

152
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,919
But when I took my findings

153
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,440
to confront Chen Hai,

154
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,279
his reaction was very suspicious.

155
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,039
Alright.

156
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,600
Since you're so confident,

157
00:09:18,799 --> 00:09:20,399
then get to the bottom of it.

158
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:22,279
The chairman entrusted the company to me.

159
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,080
I won't let

160
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,840
a massive group enterprise like this

161
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,720
fall apart over a few bad apples.

162
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,039
Infiltrating a large corporation

163
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:38,559
to pull off illegal schemes under our noses...

164
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,039
This Chen Hai

165
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,159
is no simple character.

166
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,000
Eat something.

167
00:09:58,559 --> 00:09:59,480
If you don't stay alive,

168
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:01,399
how will you ever see your boyfriend again?

169
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:05,919
People always need hope to keep living.

170
00:10:08,279 --> 00:10:10,600
You didn't take me to avenge your brother.

171
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,960
What are you saying? I don't follow.

172
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,519
You did it out of jealousy.

173
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:26,120
Jealous that I love someone else.

174
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:29,000
And the man I love happens to be a cop.

175
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:31,159
That's the real reason you hate me.

176
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:37,279
Don't think you know me so well.

177
00:10:40,159 --> 00:10:41,919
When you walked me home out of nowhere,

178
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,120
did you actually think

179
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:45,679
I would fall for you?

180
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,240
That I'd ever be with someone like you?

181
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,120
What kind of person am I?

182
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,399
You're a criminal.

183
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:54,679
A lunatic.

184
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,279
A pathetic wretch no one will ever love.

185
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:00,919
Fine.

186
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,000
Between the two of us right now,

187
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,000
who's more pathetic?

188
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,080
You don't know me.

189
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,159
I don't blame you.

190
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:14,879
A lot of people call me evil.

191
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:17,159
But in this world,

192
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:21,080
who really wants to be the villain?

193
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,120
You chose the path you took.

194
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,600
Nobody forced you.

195
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,799
You know the first time I went to prison,

196
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,600
what it was for?

197
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,039
The first time the cops hauled me away,

198
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:40,559
it was for aggravated assault.

199
00:11:42,559 --> 00:11:43,960
The man I beat bloody

200
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:46,759
was my own father.

201
00:11:50,639 --> 00:11:51,679
You're right.

202
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:53,799
I am a lunatic.

203
00:11:55,559 --> 00:11:57,480
Because my father was a lunatic, too.

204
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,879
Like father, like son.

205
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,879
For as long as I can remember,

206
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,360
I constantly watched my dad beat my mom.

207
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:09,759
I was so small back then,

208
00:12:10,399 --> 00:12:11,399
terrified,

209
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,159
without the courage to step in and stop him.

210
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:16,720
All I could do was cower in a corner,

211
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:19,000
watching my mom get beaten black and blue.

212
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,840
Once I got a bit older and stronger,

213
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:25,320
I threw myself between them.

214
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:25,840
As I held him back,

215
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,600
I begged him to stop hitting my mom.

216
00:12:27,879 --> 00:12:29,080
Instead, the belt in his hand

217
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:32,399
lashed across my body, too.

218
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,600
I was barely ten years old.

219
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,919
A level of terror and rage

220
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:41,720
that ordinary kids could never imagine

221
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,919
was routine for me.

222
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,080
When I was 17,

223
00:12:52,039 --> 00:12:53,639
I finally summoned the courage.

224
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,320
With my bare fists,

225
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,039
I took back dignity for my mom and myself.

226
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,080
But ever since that day,

227
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:06,919
I stepped onto a path of no return.

228
00:13:10,679 --> 00:13:13,000
That's just an excuse for your choices.

229
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:15,120
If you thought your dad was a bad man,

230
00:13:16,159 --> 00:13:17,720
why didn't you choose to be good?

231
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,840
The person I thought was the best

232
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,799
betrayed me.

233
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:29,679
The one who called the cops on me

234
00:13:30,519 --> 00:13:31,559
wasn't a stranger.

235
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,159
It was my mom.

236
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:59,240
That time I drove to pick you up

237
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,320
and brought you home,

238
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:04,000
I was so nervous.

239
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:06,720
The entire drive,

240
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,480
I didn't even know what I was saying.

241
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,200
And I had no way to tell you who I was.

242
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,960
But a night like that

243
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:19,320
was, in my entire life,

244
00:14:20,159 --> 00:14:20,799
the happiest time.

245
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,559
You know

246
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:23,840
we could never be.

247
00:14:25,919 --> 00:14:27,759
I'm saying this just to tell you

248
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,960
I still hold a shred of goodwill for you.

249
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,799
I hope you won't use malice

250
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:35,919
to repay my kindness.

251
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,679
Right now, I want you to stay alive.

252
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,960
And I want you to see with your own eyes

253
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,759
the person you love

254
00:14:45,159 --> 00:14:46,480
die by my hands.

255
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,320
You'll definitely lose to him.

256
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,519
Until it's over,

257
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,039
you can't be sure.

258
00:14:59,519 --> 00:15:00,519
You'll regret this.

259
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,639
Then stay alive,

260
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:05,679
and wait for the day I regret it.

261
00:15:10,399 --> 00:15:10,840
Come on.

262
00:15:12,519 --> 00:15:13,279
Untie me.

263
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:14,559
I'll eat on my own.

264
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:18,679
If you don't want me to die,

265
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:21,519
then untie me.

266
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:44,399
Eat up.

267
00:16:27,039 --> 00:16:27,679
Let me go!

268
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:38,159
Let go of me!

269
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,000
Let me go!

270
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:40,600
Let—

271
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,320
If anyone dares come closer,

272
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,080
I'll die right here!

273
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,039
Stay away from me!

274
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,080
Go ahead and die, then!

275
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,080
Do it!

276
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,559
Nobody's stopping you!

277
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:09,839
If you don't have the guts,

278
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,279
don't stand here acting tough!

279
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:24,519
Why?

280
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,759
Why are you doing this to me?

281
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,240
Why?

282
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,519
Why?

283
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:38,759
Let go! Let me go!

284
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:48,799
Liang Wenbiao called.

285
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,039
He wants us to make the deal tomorrow.

286
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,759
It's about time.

287
00:17:54,599 --> 00:17:55,400
What I asked you to prepare,

288
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,079
is it ready?

289
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,079
Here.

290
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,480
Tomorrow's deal is a suicide mission.

291
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,240
Whether I make it out alive

292
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,119
depends on you.

293
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,319
President Jiang.

294
00:20:08,079 --> 00:20:09,160
What's so confidential

295
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,200
that you had to meet me here?

296
00:20:12,319 --> 00:20:13,440
Look what you've done!

297
00:20:14,319 --> 00:20:16,160
I don't follow you, President Jiang.

298
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,640
You're only in Longze Group because of me.

299
00:20:20,079 --> 00:20:22,559
Runze Commerce joined Longze Group

300
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,799
only because I asked the chairman.

301
00:20:25,799 --> 00:20:27,200
I never in my wildest dreams expected

302
00:20:27,519 --> 00:20:28,720
you'd be audacious enough

303
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,680
to use Longze Group for money laundering!

304
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:32,400
Have you...

305
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,839
Have you completely lost your mind?

306
00:20:36,599 --> 00:20:38,759
President Jiang, your reaction right now

307
00:20:39,039 --> 00:20:40,279
really comes as a surprise.

308
00:20:42,119 --> 00:20:43,079
What do you mean?

309
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:45,799
Between Runze Commerce and Longze Group's

310
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:47,880
other subsidiaries, every transaction

311
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:49,920
went directly through your hands.

312
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,440
When you took my money back then,

313
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,720
you just turned a blind eye.

314
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:58,759
Now that Gu Xiaoyi is here,

315
00:20:59,359 --> 00:21:00,640
you want to trim your sails?

316
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:01,640
You...

317
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,720
You told me back then

318
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,440
it was to fix Runze Commerce's tax issues!

319
00:21:08,079 --> 00:21:08,440
But...

320
00:21:09,039 --> 00:21:11,640
All these illegal schemes behind my back,

321
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,640
you never mentioned a word of them to me!

322
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:14,039
Give me a break.

323
00:21:14,279 --> 00:21:15,359
Stop playing the innocent victim with me.

324
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,039
What Runze Commerce was doing,

325
00:21:17,039 --> 00:21:17,920
you knew full well all along.

326
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:18,319
What?

327
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,599
You pocket the benefits when it suits you,

328
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,480
and now that trouble hits,

329
00:21:21,839 --> 00:21:23,000
you want to wash your hands clean?

330
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:24,960
Chen Hai, Chen Hai...

331
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,799
We're old classmates,

332
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:28,119
lifelong friends!

333
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:28,799
I...

334
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:31,200
I helped you. You can't ruin me!

335
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:32,680
All right, that's enough.

336
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:34,960
Let's both stop putting on an act.

337
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,880
You just keep being an executive director,

338
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,359
and regarding my business,

339
00:21:40,599 --> 00:21:42,119
keep pretending you know nothing.

340
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:44,400
Rest assured,

341
00:21:45,079 --> 00:21:46,359
even if I get exposed one day,

342
00:21:47,279 --> 00:21:48,519
I won't drag you down with me.

343
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:51,279
After all, I don't sell out my own people.

344
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,680
Besides, if things truly go south,

345
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:55,759
turning you in

346
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:57,680
would only add another charge to my list.

347
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:58,559
What good does that do me?

348
00:21:59,559 --> 00:21:59,960
Then...

349
00:22:01,559 --> 00:22:03,079
What do you plan to do next?

350
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,680
She's just a CFO.

351
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,759
Teach her a harsh lesson,

352
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,960
and she'll learn her place.

353
00:22:14,039 --> 00:22:15,880
You're going to target Gu Xiaoyi?

354
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,519
You...

355
00:22:37,039 --> 00:22:37,440
Thanks.

356
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,200
The deal is set for 10:00 AM tomorrow

357
00:22:40,559 --> 00:22:42,400
at the New Town Plaza underground garage.

358
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:43,920
New Town Plaza?

359
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,119
Are you sure?

360
00:22:45,319 --> 00:22:46,519
Liang Wenbiao said it himself.

361
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,200
Last time Li Qiang and Liang Wenbiao met,

362
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:54,000
the deal was set at the Financial Tower.

363
00:22:55,039 --> 00:22:57,319
Liang Wenbiao thinks we're tailing him.

364
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,599
Why would he choose

365
00:22:59,839 --> 00:23:01,960
a public place for the deal again?

366
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,640
Maybe Xiao Kang's death

367
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,000
dispelled his suspicions.

368
00:23:09,559 --> 00:23:10,799
During the last deal,

369
00:23:11,599 --> 00:23:13,160
a suspicious vehicle appeared.

370
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,640
Tomorrow's deal won't be simple either.

371
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,079
You must be careful.

372
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:18,039
Also,

373
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:20,359
we can't rule out a location change.

374
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,079
Stay in touch with us at all times.

375
00:23:22,359 --> 00:23:22,759
Got it.

376
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,240
Here's what you wanted.

377
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,200
We can finally close the net.

378
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:34,400
Yeah.

379
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:37,000
We've finally reached this day.

380
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:38,880
Good work.

381
00:23:44,759 --> 00:23:46,039
Arresting Li Qiang tomorrow

382
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:49,079
concerns Tian Xin, Zhuang Yan,

383
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:51,319
and Ge Dan's safety.

384
00:23:52,839 --> 00:23:54,119
Let's hope everything goes smoothly.

385
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,640
You've made quite an improvement.

386
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:42,319
It's all thanks to you, Uncle Lin.

387
00:24:43,839 --> 00:24:45,880
What could I possibly teach you?

388
00:24:47,759 --> 00:24:49,440
If anything, you should be teaching me.

389
00:24:52,079 --> 00:24:54,480
As for that parking lot proposal...

390
00:24:55,119 --> 00:24:55,960
I took a look.

391
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:56,799
It's really good.

392
00:24:57,640 --> 00:25:00,200
I'll have my assistant contact you.

393
00:25:00,599 --> 00:25:01,160
Great.

394
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,279
Thank you, Uncle Lin.

395
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:04,880
President Long.

396
00:25:05,279 --> 00:25:05,720
You have a call.

397
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,559
Excuse me, I need to take this.

398
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:10,400
Sure.

399
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,359
I'll wait for you at the diner.

400
00:25:12,359 --> 00:25:12,640
Okay.

401
00:25:17,519 --> 00:25:18,079
Honey.

402
00:25:19,039 --> 00:25:20,480
Chen Hai is definitely dirty.

403
00:25:20,559 --> 00:25:22,519
But President Jiang wants to downplay it.

404
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,920
I'll call Jiang Shan.

405
00:25:27,039 --> 00:25:28,319
Just do what you think is right.

406
00:25:29,279 --> 00:25:31,559
Behavior that harms our group...

407
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,039
...will never be tolerated.

408
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,519
Longze Group

409
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,400
will never take the fall for anyone

410
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:38,359
breaking the law.

411
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,920
Do what needs to be done.

412
00:25:41,599 --> 00:25:43,079
I'll back you up 100 percent.

413
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,759
Okay, understood.

414
00:26:32,079 --> 00:26:33,319
We interrupt with breaking news.

415
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:35,200
In Dongfang Park, police

416
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,000
found the bodies of a man and a woman.

417
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:39,319
The victims' identities have been confirmed.

418
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:41,359
Police are stepping up their investigation.

419
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:43,720
We remind all drivers

420
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,359
to stay safe on the road.

421
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:47,839
If in danger, call the police right away.

422
00:27:24,319 --> 00:27:24,799
Get out of the car!

423
00:27:25,319 --> 00:27:26,519
Get out! Out of the car!

424
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:29,440
Hurry up! Get out of the car!

425
00:27:32,519 --> 00:27:33,599
Come on, get out, now!

426
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,799
Hello, is this the police?

427
00:27:38,039 --> 00:27:40,000
I'm on Shuncheng Avenue! I'm being attacked!

428
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:46,880
Get out!

429
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:48,039
What do you want?!

430
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:49,119
Get out!

431
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,599
Wait, who are you people?!

432
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,200
Shut up.

433
00:28:00,359 --> 00:28:01,480
Miss Gu.

434
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,119
Someone asked me to pass along a message.

435
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:06,480
If it's none of your business,

436
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:07,880
stay out of it.

437
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,839
Who the hell are you?!

438
00:28:11,319 --> 00:28:12,799
I could tell you who I am,

439
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,559
but it's not time yet.

440
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:18,920
Because you don't have to die tonight.

441
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:22,160
Just remember,

442
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:24,240
play with fire and you'll get burned.

443
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,359
Watch your step.

444
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:39,160
Help!

445
00:28:39,599 --> 00:28:40,319
Help!

446
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,440
Save me!

447
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:42,960
Help me!

448
00:28:46,599 --> 00:28:48,119
None of your business. Get lost!

449
00:28:52,519 --> 00:28:53,359
I'm talking to you!

450
00:28:53,759 --> 00:28:54,559
Told you, stay out of this!

451
00:28:54,559 --> 00:28:55,240
Get lost!

452
00:29:02,799 --> 00:29:03,279
Get him!

453
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:34,480
I'll remember you.

454
00:29:34,799 --> 00:29:35,279
Let's go.

455
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:37,519
Consider yourself lucky today.

456
00:29:52,359 --> 00:29:53,039
Are you all right?

457
00:29:54,119 --> 00:29:54,559
I'm fine.

458
00:29:55,079 --> 00:29:56,359
Thank you so much for earlier.

459
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,599
Be careful from now on.

460
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:03,160
What's your name?

461
00:30:04,039 --> 00:30:05,240
Whatever you do, don't tell the police

462
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,160
you saw me.

463
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:29,400
In other words,

464
00:30:29,559 --> 00:30:31,680
they didn't pull you over to rob you.

465
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:33,920
No.

466
00:30:34,720 --> 00:30:37,000
They just said they were passing along a message.

467
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,039
A message?

468
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,000
What message?

469
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:42,480
They told me to watch my step from now on.

470
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:46,400
Have you offended anyone recently?

471
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:48,759
Or is there anyone you suspect?

472
00:31:16,319 --> 00:31:16,880
You wanted to see me?

473
00:31:18,799 --> 00:31:19,279
Dana.

474
00:31:20,319 --> 00:31:21,640
The deal is happening soon.

475
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:24,400
Why do I feel so uneasy?

476
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:26,880
Same here.

477
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:29,960
I think this kid Li Qiang is unreliable.

478
00:31:32,799 --> 00:31:34,000
I'm not talking about Li Qiang.

479
00:31:35,119 --> 00:31:37,039
I had you look into Wei Kai a while back.

480
00:31:37,799 --> 00:31:39,079
Did you find anything?

481
00:31:41,119 --> 00:31:41,720
Brother Biao,

482
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:45,240
you suspect Wei Kai?

483
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:47,799
That can't be.

484
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:50,039
He was the one who shot Xiaokang.

485
00:31:55,359 --> 00:31:56,440
That may be so,

486
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,599
but something feels off.

487
00:32:07,599 --> 00:32:08,839
At ten this morning,

488
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:12,240
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang will meet

489
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,400
at New Town Plaza's underground garage.

490
00:32:13,880 --> 00:32:14,960
For this operation,

491
00:32:15,079 --> 00:32:17,319
we'll still split into Teams A, B, and C.

492
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:21,559
Guan Qiang and Li Xiao lead Teams A and B,

493
00:32:21,839 --> 00:32:24,319
entering from Entrances One and Two

494
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:25,279
of the parking lot.

495
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:27,599
Captain Lu and I will lead Team C.

496
00:32:27,799 --> 00:32:29,359
From Liang Wenbiao's departure point,

497
00:32:29,559 --> 00:32:30,599
we'll conduct remote surveillance.

498
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:33,160
We'll update his location in real time.

499
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:35,799
Due to heavy traffic at New Town Plaza,

500
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:38,359
CID will secure the outer perimeter.

501
00:32:38,599 --> 00:32:40,799
I want us to apprehend the suspects

502
00:32:40,799 --> 00:32:41,720
inside the parking lot.

503
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:43,720
Regarding this operation,

504
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:44,920
does anyone have any questions?

505
00:32:46,279 --> 00:32:48,279
We almost caught Li Qiang twice.

506
00:32:48,279 --> 00:32:49,680
He'll be extremely cautious this time.

507
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,599
The parking lot has four access points.

508
00:32:51,759 --> 00:32:53,519
Once we control all of them,

509
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,759
there'll be no way out for him.

510
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,920
From what we know about Li Qiang,

511
00:32:57,359 --> 00:32:58,599
he won't be this careless.

512
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:03,440
The time and location for this deal

513
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:05,559
don't really match

514
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:07,079
what we know about them.

515
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:08,720
Also, we're not sure right now

516
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:10,640
whether they'll change the time

517
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:11,160
and location midway.

518
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:14,319
Li Qiang and Liang Wenbiao are armed.

519
00:33:14,559 --> 00:33:15,799
They're extremely dangerous.

520
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:16,880
So, Teams A and B,

521
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:19,240
set up your positions in the lot early.

522
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:21,640
If anything changes with the suspects,

523
00:33:21,839 --> 00:33:23,039
I'll notify you in advance.

524
00:33:23,599 --> 00:33:25,359
Both teams need to stay flexible.

525
00:33:26,559 --> 00:33:27,799
Two more things to note.

526
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:31,039
When Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang met last time,

527
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:32,720
a suspicious vehicle appeared.

528
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,960
So during this operation,

529
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:37,839
first, stay alert to your surroundings.

530
00:33:38,559 --> 00:33:38,920
Second,

531
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,680
do not compromise your positions.

532
00:33:41,720 --> 00:33:42,880
If there are no other questions,

533
00:33:43,359 --> 00:33:43,960
let's move out.

534
00:35:38,400 --> 00:35:38,920
Brother Biao,

535
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,320
If we strike it rich this time,

536
00:35:41,719 --> 00:35:43,440
aren't you taking us out to have some fun?

537
00:35:44,079 --> 00:35:44,800
Yeah, Brother Biao.

538
00:35:45,519 --> 00:35:46,480
All the goods we're moving

539
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:48,079
come from Jiechan State.

540
00:35:48,519 --> 00:35:50,039
We should at least go check it out.

541
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:52,119
The casinos over there are great.

542
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:54,079
Why don't we try our luck too?

543
00:35:55,159 --> 00:35:56,079
Are you out of your mind?

544
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,119
We run casinos ourselves.

545
00:35:58,119 --> 00:36:00,039
You of all people should know whether anyone wins!

546
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,239
No wonder whenever I play there,

547
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:05,360
I never win a dime.

548
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,519
You rigged it!

549
00:36:09,599 --> 00:36:10,159
Brother Kai,

550
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:12,039
you can't blame us for that.

551
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:13,480
If you want to hold someone accountable,

552
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,119
take it up with our boss.

553
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,000
Ah Kai,

554
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,320
we run casinos.

555
00:36:21,679 --> 00:36:23,400
All we think about is taking money from others' pockets

556
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:25,079
and putting it into our own.

557
00:36:25,239 --> 00:36:26,320
How could the house ever lose?

558
00:36:29,119 --> 00:36:29,800
Don't worry about it.

559
00:36:30,199 --> 00:36:31,079
Next time,

560
00:36:31,079 --> 00:36:31,920
I'll let you be the dealer.

561
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:34,119
You can win back double what you lost.

562
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:36,920
Deal?

563
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:41,880
Brother Biao,

564
00:36:42,719 --> 00:36:45,360
looks like a car has been tailing us.

565
00:36:48,119 --> 00:36:48,760
Really?

566
00:36:50,199 --> 00:36:50,760
Doesn't matter.

567
00:36:50,840 --> 00:36:52,280
Let them follow if they want.

568
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:56,000
We'll take a few turns before we arrive.

569
00:36:57,239 --> 00:36:58,760
If we put on an act, we go all the way.

570
00:37:00,079 --> 00:37:00,599
Brother Biao,

571
00:37:01,599 --> 00:37:02,639
aren't we heading to a deal?

572
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,480
Why put on an act?

573
00:37:05,599 --> 00:37:06,719
We are going to make a deal.

574
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:09,519
But on this one,

575
00:37:10,119 --> 00:37:11,519
I want to make a little extra.

576
00:37:39,519 --> 00:37:40,880
Is a vehicle tailing Liang Wenbiao?

577
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:42,199
Yes.

578
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:44,199
But we've been tailing from a distance.

579
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:49,599
Team A, Team B,

580
00:37:50,159 --> 00:37:51,239
report your route

581
00:37:51,400 --> 00:37:52,360
and current location.

582
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:53,400
Team B is moving from Wenjia Lane

583
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,960
onto New Town Plaza South Street.

584
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,519
Team A is on Shangcheng Avenue,

585
00:37:59,639 --> 00:38:01,000
almost at New Town Plaza.

586
00:38:13,559 --> 00:38:14,000
Captain Bai.

587
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:14,920
Captain Shen.

588
00:38:15,239 --> 00:38:16,639
Did you have someone tail Liang Wenbiao?

589
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,719
All our criminal investigation officers

590
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:21,639
are ambushing near New Oriental Plaza.

591
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:24,000
All updates on Liang Wenbiao's movements

592
00:38:24,079 --> 00:38:25,840
were provided by your narcotics team.

593
00:38:26,119 --> 00:38:26,440
Understood.

594
00:38:32,239 --> 00:38:33,239
If it isn't Li Qiang,

595
00:38:34,239 --> 00:38:36,119
that means our previous hunch was right.

596
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:37,920
Liang Wenbiao must have teamed up

597
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:38,760
with someone else for this deal.

598
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:44,000
Is it really Four-Legged Snake's crew?

599
00:39:05,519 --> 00:39:07,000
Attention all units. Attention all units.

600
00:39:07,400 --> 00:39:10,800
Liang Wenbiao's car has entered the lot.

601
00:39:11,199 --> 00:39:13,000
Current location, current location.

602
00:39:13,239 --> 00:39:16,599
Zone C, Space 137. Zone C, Space 137.

603
00:39:28,239 --> 00:39:28,679
Brother Biao,

604
00:39:30,079 --> 00:39:32,239
should we check where that kid is?

605
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,239
What's the rush?

606
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,960
The kid's completely spooked right now.

607
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:40,800
He won't show up until the last minute.

608
00:39:54,679 --> 00:39:56,320
That car already showed up once earlier.

609
00:39:58,519 --> 00:39:59,000
Captain Bai,

610
00:39:59,719 --> 00:40:01,000
we've spotted a suspicious vehicle

611
00:40:01,559 --> 00:40:03,599
lingering at parking Entrance Two.

612
00:40:04,199 --> 00:40:06,039
It's a white Mazda sedan.

613
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:10,440
Plate number Chang D24653.

614
00:40:11,599 --> 00:40:12,199
Give me Entrance B.

615
00:40:12,360 --> 00:40:12,679
Copy that.

616
00:40:20,519 --> 00:40:21,119
Head to Entrance B.

617
00:40:34,159 --> 00:40:34,719
He Bo.

618
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:35,880
Go down and grab a bottle of water.

619
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:37,239
Careful not to blow your cover.

620
00:40:37,719 --> 00:40:38,199
Copy that.

621
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:49,960
This license plate is from Chang'an.

622
00:40:50,280 --> 00:40:51,559
Both Li Qiang and Four-Legged Snake

623
00:40:51,719 --> 00:40:53,079
have been spotted in Chang'an before.

624
00:41:02,079 --> 00:41:03,679
Attention, all units. Attention, all units.

625
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,639
Stand by in place. Stay covered.

626
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:06,320
Copy that.

627
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:24,119
Brother Biao, time's up.

628
00:41:26,079 --> 00:41:27,199
What's this kid up to?

629
00:41:28,239 --> 00:41:29,400
Could he be playing us?

630
00:41:43,119 --> 00:41:44,559
What's bound to happen will happen.

631
00:41:46,599 --> 00:41:48,920
Brother Qiang, changed spots again?

632
00:41:49,519 --> 00:41:51,320
You can't keep playing hide-and-seek like this.

633
00:41:53,719 --> 00:41:55,480
Being careful is better for all of us.

634
00:41:56,519 --> 00:41:57,639
Just wait for my call.

635
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:58,800
That's all.

636
00:41:59,079 --> 00:41:59,760
Alright.

637
00:42:18,239 --> 00:42:19,280
The deal location has changed.

638
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:21,679
The destination is unclear right now.

639
00:42:24,519 --> 00:42:25,440
All we can do now...

640
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:26,559
...is stay tight on the suspect.

641
00:42:30,599 --> 00:42:31,159
Teams A and B,

642
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:32,480
get in your vehicles and stand by.

643
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:34,519
Prepare to tail Liang Wenbiao remotely,

644
00:42:34,519 --> 00:42:35,599
and monitor the Mazda's movements.

645
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,320
CID,

646
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:39,320
pull back 10 minutes after Liang leaves.

647
00:42:39,519 --> 00:42:40,119
Stand by for orders,

648
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:41,679
ready to back them up at any time.

649
00:42:42,679 --> 00:42:44,039
Where are we headed now, Brother Biao?

650
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:45,800
East Street.

651
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:58,159
Target's heading for East Street.

652
00:42:58,400 --> 00:42:59,519
Xiao Ding, pull up East Street.

653
00:42:59,679 --> 00:43:00,039
Copy that.

654
00:43:00,039 --> 00:43:00,639
All units, be advised.

655
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:02,119
The suspect is heading toward East Street.

656
00:43:02,239 --> 00:43:02,679
Move in.

657
00:43:08,519 --> 00:43:09,880
We're behind the suspect's vehicle.

658
00:43:09,960 --> 00:43:12,199
About 50 meters from the suspect's car.

659
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:15,159
That Mazda behind us is catching up.
